cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "HF Titration Assistant: an explainable ML prototype for deterioration-risk scoring in hospital-at-home heart-failure care"
abstract: >-
  A research prototype that estimates short-term deterioration risk in
  heart-failure patients under hospital-at-home care from the sliding-window
  trajectory of their vitals, labs, and symptoms, with SHAP-based explanations
  and a clinician-facing dashboard. Trained and evaluated on synthetic data and
  small open-access clinical demo subsets; not clinically validated.
type: software
